WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.072
From Workplaces, open the more menu and
choose Import roster.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:08.500
This example starts with pasted shift text.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:14.685
Tap Analyze, then check the proposed
workplace, dates and times against the
original.

00:00:15.685 --> 00:00:20.286
These two shifts are on the same day, so
don't mistake them for a repeating
rotation.

00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:24.123
Fix anything that's wrong before you apply
the import.

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:28.934
Applying adds the plan; opening the preview
hasn't saved it yet.

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:33.042
Read the result, then check the workplace
and Calendar.

00:00:33.942 --> 00:00:38.523
Photos, files and scans start analysing
after their text is extracted.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:43.383
If you edit pasted text, run Analyze again
before using that result.
